WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.230 --> 00:14.460
[Ryu Seil]

3
00:18.880 --> 00:22.340
[Ha Junghoon]

4
00:26.410 --> 00:29.660
[Lee Jungchan]

5
00:33.480 --> 00:36.980
[Jeong Siwan]

6
00:42.340 --> 00:47.020
[Boy, with Caution]

7
01:29.330 --> 01:31.130
Mr. Jang, I want to talk to you.

8
01:29.850 --> 01:32.729
[Are you sure you want to start a new conversation with "Regret"?]

9
01:33.020 --> 01:33.920
[Yes]

10
01:37.400 --> 01:39.100
I'm talking about the counseling.

11
01:39.100 --> 01:54.860
[Boy, with Caution] [Episode 3]

12
01:51.400 --> 01:54.979
Regret, I want to know more about you.

13
02:25.740 --> 02:27.430
I'm a pretty boring person.

14
02:28.079 --> 02:31.829
[I'm a pretty boring person. What kind of person are you?]

15
02:29.260 --> 02:31.860
What kind of person are you?

16
02:34.530 --> 02:36.900
Because you don't seem to care about anything.

17
02:36.900 --> 02:38.960
Only students like that act this way—

18
02:39.670 --> 02:40.820
students like you.

19
02:48.329 --> 02:54.130
[I'm someone who doesn't really care about anything.]

20
02:50.350 --> 02:53.280
I'm someone who doesn't really care about anything.

21
02:57.730 --> 03:00.530
But if we can't get the goods from Lee Hyunjae,

22
03:00.660 --> 03:02.460
our business won't work, right?

23
03:02.650 --> 03:04.170
We don't need him anymore.

24
03:04.450 --> 03:05.910
There's a guy named Jitae.

25
03:05.930 --> 03:08.410
He used to be a senior at our school, but was expelled 2 years ago.

26
03:08.410 --> 03:11.740
His distribution channels are amazing. He can get any drug.

27
03:12.170 --> 03:14.360
That guy's really scary, isn't he?

28
03:14.570 --> 03:16.240
I heard he even killed someone.

29
03:16.240 --> 03:17.530
You believe that?

30
03:24.770 --> 03:26.630
That new contract worker

31
03:27.770 --> 03:30.300
is really covering for Lee Hyunjae.

32
03:30.320 --> 03:31.690
He just can't read the room—

33
03:31.690 --> 03:32.920
that's why he's still a contract worker at his age.

34
03:32.920 --> 03:33.860
Tell me about it.

35
03:34.100 --> 03:35.960
He's so good at pretending.

36
03:36.090 --> 03:38.450
"If Hyunjae admits it, I'll report him to the disciplinary committee."

37
03:38.450 --> 03:40.860
What if he doesn't admit it? What are you going to do?

38
03:40.860 --> 03:42.680
That darn Jang Kiwoo.

39
03:44.310 --> 03:45.500
What the. Who was that?

40
03:45.500 --> 03:47.030
Which bastard tossed this?

41
03:49.180 --> 03:50.710
Hey, isn't this your phone?

42
03:50.710 --> 03:51.590
What?

43
03:53.180 --> 03:54.120
What the hell.

44
03:56.100 --> 03:57.100
It didn't hit you.

45
03:58.530 --> 03:59.910
It's smashed to pieces.

46
04:01.320 --> 04:02.330
Take it.

47
04:02.690 --> 04:05.150
Darn it, you did that on purpose, didn't you?

48
04:05.240 --> 04:06.120
Yeah.

49
04:07.530 --> 04:08.700
Call your boss.

50
04:09.860 --> 04:11.630
What are you doing?

51
04:12.190 --> 04:13.180
Are you crazy?

52
04:13.620 --> 04:15.750
I'm saying I'll take responsibility.

53
04:15.960 --> 04:17.230
For stealing.

54
04:21.640 --> 04:24.600
If you want to see if I'm really crazy,

55
04:24.990 --> 04:27.450
try calling Jang Kiwoo's name one more time.

56
04:28.400 --> 04:29.470
And,

57
04:30.860 --> 04:33.860
if you still want to deal drugs, you have to quit drugs.

58
04:34.990 --> 04:36.990
You're already being too arrogant.

59
04:49.520 --> 04:50.960
Darn it!

60
04:53.240 --> 04:54.580
Kim Jungha.

61
04:55.230 --> 04:57.030
Where did that kid Kim Jungha go?

62
04:59.440 --> 05:01.220
Darn it, where is Kim Jungha?

63
05:06.210 --> 05:07.130
Hey.

64
05:07.340 --> 05:08.870
Hey, I'm asking you where Kim Jungha is.

65
05:08.870 --> 05:09.900
So noisy.

66
05:10.260 --> 05:11.540
Why are you looking for Kim Jungha?

67
05:11.540 --> 05:12.650
None of your business.

68
05:12.650 --> 05:15.180
If it's none of my business, don't be so noisy.

69
05:16.970 --> 05:18.100
What if I refuse?

70
05:28.750 --> 05:29.870
Did you do this?

71
05:36.970 --> 05:38.400
Let's talk.

72
05:42.480 --> 05:43.990
I have nothing to talk about.

73
05:43.990 --> 05:46.480
Darn it, what do you mean?

74
05:47.400 --> 05:49.600
I hired you.

75
05:49.760 --> 05:52.270
You took the deposit. Do you think denying it makes it okay?

76
05:52.270 --> 05:56.000
You took the money, so you have to do the job, vending machine.

77
06:05.380 --> 06:06.430
Kim Jungha.

78
06:10.880 --> 06:12.040
Where are you going?

79
06:22.820 --> 06:23.920
The hospital.

80
06:24.180 --> 06:26.510
I'm my grandmother's only family member.

81
06:31.150 --> 06:31.940
Your phone.

82
06:32.080 --> 06:33.650
I'll hand it in next time.

83
06:34.409 --> 06:35.500
Give it to me.

84
06:48.220 --> 06:49.300
Here's my phone number.

85
06:49.300 --> 06:51.100
Contact me if you need anything.

86
06:54.420 --> 06:55.909
Nothing will happen.

87
06:56.030 --> 06:58.970
Everything you're telling me now is something.

88
06:59.400 --> 07:00.570
So,

89
07:01.070 --> 07:03.700
call me even if there's the slightest problem.

90
07:13.340 --> 07:15.510
You'll be misunderstood like this.

91
07:17.470 --> 07:20.530
I mean, don't be too affectionate with these students.

92
07:20.620 --> 07:22.490
They might get the wrong idea.

93
07:25.600 --> 07:28.150
Especially those who are already lonely.

94
07:30.590 --> 07:32.580
Let's talk about you first.

95
07:33.159 --> 07:36.190
I heard you studied abroad for 2 years. How was it?

96
07:37.340 --> 07:38.909
I never studied abroad.

97
07:41.600 --> 07:42.570
Okay.

98
07:43.470 --> 07:46.200
Then what have you been doing for the past 2 years?

99
07:46.909 --> 07:48.220
A bit of everything.

100
07:50.409 --> 07:53.540
Can you tell me about your biggest difficulty recently?

101
07:58.320 --> 08:00.260
Why did you take Youngmoon's phone?

102
08:00.260 --> 08:02.120
I already plan to compensate him.

103
08:02.650 --> 08:04.450
Is the counseling session over?

104
08:15.530 --> 08:17.650
[Regret: Have you ever misunderstood someone's affection for you?]

105
08:16.060 --> 08:19.950
Have you ever misunderstood someone's affection for you?

106
08:28.670 --> 08:29.650
Yes.

107
08:33.700 --> 08:35.700
I think I'm misunderstanding it...

108
08:38.780 --> 08:39.900
right now.

109
08:45.270 --> 08:46.760
Is the counseling already over?

110
08:46.760 --> 08:48.570
Didn't I say I wanted to talk to you?

111
08:48.570 --> 08:51.030
There are professional counselors. Why me?

112
08:51.110 --> 08:53.230
If it weren't for you,

113
08:53.370 --> 08:55.770
I wouldn't have to do any counseling at all.

114
08:56.610 --> 08:58.810
You said you were willing to accept counseling—

115
08:58.810 --> 09:00.220
was that because of me?

116
09:02.380 --> 09:03.710
Is that not okay?

117
09:06.570 --> 09:07.650
Yes.

118
09:09.110 --> 09:10.160
Why?

119
09:12.030 --> 09:13.810
That puts me in a tight spot.

120
09:16.060 --> 09:19.550
As the matter between you and Youngmoon wraps up, neither of you will be punished.

121
09:19.550 --> 09:21.080
Starting next week, go for the counseling sessions properly.

122
09:21.080 --> 09:22.340
What if I don't want to?

123
09:24.560 --> 09:28.640
If you don't want to, then forget it.

124
09:29.890 --> 09:30.950
See you tomorrow.

125
09:41.650 --> 09:44.050
This is the first time I've felt affection.

126
09:54.840 --> 09:56.520
If you say it's the first time,

127
09:57.770 --> 09:59.690
how do you know it's affection?

128
10:05.940 --> 10:07.850
Because that's how I feel.

129
10:17.320 --> 10:21.120
Regret, you're the kind who'd make people get the wrong idea, right?

130
10:28.970 --> 10:31.000
I don't think I've done that before.

131
10:31.180 --> 10:32.910
Can I get a Terea Bold, please?

132
10:39.930 --> 10:41.790
What do you think affection is?

133
10:43.620 --> 10:45.110
When do you feel it?

134
10:48.130 --> 10:49.410
Hard to say.

135
10:49.780 --> 10:51.710
I haven't felt it in a long time.

136
10:53.810 --> 10:55.250
Are you married?

137
10:56.430 --> 10:57.400
Yeah.

138
10:58.040 --> 10:59.500
I got married quite early.

139
11:12.180 --> 11:13.300
But...

140
11:14.640 --> 11:16.680
you don't know what affection is?

141
11:19.980 --> 11:24.580
I don't know what I gave my wife—

142
11:32.520 --> 11:34.420
whether it was affection or love.

143
11:42.760 --> 11:45.490
Whatever it was, it must have been pretty boring,

144
11:45.610 --> 11:47.610
since that's the kind of person I am.

145
11:48.460 --> 11:51.840
[I don't know what I gave my wife—whether it was affection or love. Whatever it was, it must have been pretty boring, since that's the kind of person I am.]

146
11:56.810 --> 12:03.220
[I liked my wife more.]

147
11:58.310 --> 12:00.870
I liked my wife more.

148
12:03.220 --> 12:06.510
[Liked my wife more... wife... wedding ring?]

149
12:03.490 --> 12:07.160
How should we view Imprinting Behavior?

150
12:08.040 --> 12:09.190
For example...

151
12:09.570 --> 12:11.370
Let's look at it with an example.

152
12:11.990 --> 12:14.580
Suppose a prison inmate committed theft.

153
12:25.240 --> 12:28.690
Deviance is not the maturation of the behavior itself,

154
12:28.830 --> 12:31.680
but the mutual response during its practice,

155
12:31.810 --> 12:35.100
which depends on the label.

156
12:35.340 --> 12:37.150
From a micro perspective...

157
12:39.370 --> 12:40.500
Come on, quiet down.

158
12:41.510 --> 12:43.690
Good job on today's competition, everyone.

159
12:43.690 --> 12:46.080
In the future, I hope you don't just work hard and do your best,

160
12:46.080 --> 12:48.630
but also strive to produce some results, you brats. Understood?

161
12:48.630 --> 12:49.400
-Understood. -Understood.

162
12:49.400 --> 12:52.730
All right, Yooyoung, come to the front. Everyone, applaud.

163
12:53.100 --> 12:54.030
Come here.

164
12:55.200 --> 12:58.380
Thank you so much for winning the bronze medal and barely saving our school's pride.

165
12:58.380 --> 13:00.600
Next time, you need to win at least a silver medal

166
13:00.600 --> 13:03.060
to restore our school's glory. Understood?

167
13:03.140 --> 13:03.890
Yes.

168
13:04.460 --> 13:05.390
You guys, shh.

169
13:05.540 --> 13:06.600
Listen, as for training,

170
13:06.600 --> 13:07.980
there won't be any tomorrow,

171
13:07.980 --> 13:09.220
nor the day after.

172
13:09.450 --> 13:11.140
Applaud!

173
13:11.860 --> 13:16.790
Alright, everyone gather at the spicy ribs restaurant at the intersection. Dismissed.

174
13:19.580 --> 13:20.910
What are you doing here?

175
13:29.550 --> 13:31.210
You haven't eaten yet, right?

176
13:36.390 --> 13:40.000
You're wearing a cast. Your wrist must be badly injured.

177
13:40.780 --> 13:43.980
They said I just need to rest for a week.

178
13:45.520 --> 13:46.800
Really.

179
13:47.970 --> 13:49.060
Jungha.

180
13:49.710 --> 13:51.990
Since you're doing sports just to make a living,

181
13:51.990 --> 13:54.340
you can do anything else.

182
13:54.480 --> 13:57.560
Just go work part-time at a cafe or a fried chicken joint,

183
13:57.560 --> 14:00.240
like your peers.

184
14:06.540 --> 14:08.550
I do sports because I like it.

185
14:09.830 --> 14:12.250
Living like this is really disgusting.

186
14:14.310 --> 14:16.590
This is the only thing I like.

187
14:19.240 --> 14:21.780
Just one week. I'll recover and rejoin the team.

188
14:21.780 --> 14:23.940
I just want one chance.

189
14:24.700 --> 14:26.900
Can't you just give me a chance?

190
14:33.580 --> 14:34.870
Eat up.

191
14:37.730 --> 14:39.770
Treat today as your last day.

192
14:52.350 --> 14:53.490
What's wrong with Kim Jungha?

193
14:53.490 --> 14:54.750
His wrist is crippled.

194
14:54.840 --> 14:56.410
What do you mean crippled? You're the one who's crippled.

195
14:56.410 --> 14:57.530
Do you want to die?

196
15:09.130 --> 15:11.750
Have you ever met anyone from here in person?

197
15:14.650 --> 15:15.820
Once.

198
15:16.250 --> 15:18.870
They ran away when they saw I was a guy.

199
15:19.930 --> 15:23.810
[I'm a guy. Will you run away?]

200
15:21.010 --> 15:22.430
I'm a guy.

201
15:22.600 --> 15:24.060
Will you run away?

202
15:39.740 --> 15:41.360
Are you here for lunch?

203
15:42.740 --> 15:43.680
Yes.

204
15:46.800 --> 15:48.910
Should I buy you a cup of instant noodles?

205
15:48.910 --> 15:50.170
No need.

206
16:07.930 --> 16:10.670
[Regret: I feel more comfortable with men.]

207
16:08.530 --> 16:10.440
I feel more comfortable with men.

208
17:18.829 --> 17:20.020
Mr. Jang.

209
17:20.920 --> 17:22.980
You're going to the office, right?

210
17:23.450 --> 17:24.700
Let's go together.

211
17:34.620 --> 17:36.660
Didn't I tell you

212
17:36.920 --> 17:39.020
to let Hyunjae...

213
17:40.080 --> 17:41.710
be by himself.

214
17:46.630 --> 17:48.380
Let him be an outcast.

215
17:49.070 --> 17:51.400
You don't need to worry too much about him.

216
17:53.630 --> 17:57.690
I don't understand why you keep telling me not to worry about him.

217
18:00.310 --> 18:02.540
Everything you're doing right now—

218
18:02.670 --> 18:04.430
stop doing it all.

219
18:08.750 --> 18:13.470
I want to ask... why?

220
18:18.110 --> 18:19.360
Mr. Jang.

221
18:20.890 --> 18:23.150
You have a precedent, don't you?

222
18:25.290 --> 18:26.730
Right?

223
18:31.120 --> 18:34.180
-I need to get this 500,000. -That's why I gave it to you.

224
18:36.380 --> 18:38.840
About what you wanted to discuss yesterday.

225
18:40.510 --> 18:41.690
You acted like you weren't going to do it before.

226
18:41.690 --> 18:43.170
I was scared, Jungha.

227
18:43.260 --> 18:44.550
I was afraid you'd refund me.

228
18:44.550 --> 18:47.500
You can send me the final payment today, right?

229
18:48.630 --> 18:50.080
Seems like you need money urgently.

230
18:50.080 --> 18:52.190
As long as you send me a photo to verify it,

231
18:52.190 --> 18:54.120
I'll send you the money right away.

232
19:07.750 --> 19:09.480
Come to my house after school.

233
19:09.880 --> 19:11.700
My dad is on a business trip today.

234
19:11.700 --> 19:13.780
You don't like eating dinner alone, right?

235
19:13.780 --> 19:14.930
I can't go.

236
19:16.790 --> 19:17.750
Why?

237
19:19.090 --> 19:20.350
I'm asking you why.

238
19:21.640 --> 19:23.040
I need to work part-time.

239
19:23.580 --> 19:25.910
Didn't you say you wouldn't do it anymore?

240
19:27.500 --> 19:30.440
Didn't you say that time was the last time?

241
19:30.450 --> 19:32.250
Since you promised me, don't change your mind.

242
19:32.250 --> 19:33.070
I have to change my mind.

243
19:33.070 --> 19:34.070
Hey!

244
19:34.780 --> 19:38.380
There are many things more important to me than my promise to you.

245
19:39.670 --> 19:42.270
There are many things more important to you than me too, right?

246
19:42.270 --> 19:43.670
You have to go to college.

247
19:45.870 --> 19:48.500
What if talking to me ruins your reputation?

248
19:48.570 --> 19:49.420
Reputation?

249
19:49.570 --> 19:51.570
I told you to keep things as they are.

250
20:15.180 --> 20:16.560
This is my seat.

251
20:24.900 --> 20:26.070
I know.

252
20:28.080 --> 20:29.660
I was waiting for you.

253
20:40.970 --> 20:42.990
Hyung, I'm sorry.

254
21:04.050 --> 21:05.210
Damn it.

255
21:05.810 --> 21:07.670
You can only use your feet, right?

256
21:30.720 --> 21:32.280
[Kim Jungha]

257
21:32.160 --> 21:33.490
Kim Jungha?

258
21:34.060 --> 21:35.380
Do you know me?

259
21:36.230 --> 21:38.030
Choi Youngmoon sent you, right?

260
21:53.100 --> 21:54.770
[Jang Kiwoo]

261
21:55.890 --> 21:57.350
[Missed Call: Jang Kiwoo]

262
22:05.890 --> 22:06.880
Hey.

263
22:07.070 --> 22:08.070
Hey!

264
22:10.280 --> 22:11.350
Look at me.

265
22:12.700 --> 22:13.810
Hit me.

266
22:18.420 --> 22:19.700
I told you to hit me.

267
22:20.100 --> 22:21.440
I'll take it.

268
22:34.050 --> 22:35.290
Properly.

269
22:36.990 --> 22:38.050
Thank you.

270
22:39.070 --> 22:40.670
The counseling log I gave you

271
22:40.830 --> 22:42.450
isn't really worth looking at.

272
22:42.450 --> 22:45.380
'Cause Hyunjae doesn't want to receive counseling.

273
22:46.490 --> 22:47.490
Thank you.

274
22:47.650 --> 22:48.790
I'll take a look.

275
22:51.570 --> 22:53.600
There's only 1 semester left.

276
22:55.070 --> 22:58.070
There should be more students you need to take care of.

277
22:58.640 --> 23:02.250
Hyunjae doesn't really need psychological counseling.

278
23:08.540 --> 23:10.400
Tell me when you've sorted it out.

279
23:21.240 --> 23:22.510
Mr. Jang.

280
23:25.000 --> 23:26.860
Help me apply some medicine.

281
23:38.310 --> 23:39.840
You should take the day off.

282
23:42.060 --> 23:43.330
I don't want to go home.

283
23:43.450 --> 23:45.110
Then what about after school?

284
23:47.610 --> 23:49.550
Don't wander around just because you don't want to go home.

285
23:49.550 --> 23:50.640
Just try to...

286
23:56.910 --> 23:59.710
I'll let them know you're resting for this period.

287
23:59.730 --> 24:00.820
Mr. Jang.

288
24:07.120 --> 24:09.720
I really am getting special treatment, right?

289
24:10.200 --> 24:11.520
Still?

290
24:22.530 --> 24:23.710
Let go.

291
24:23.940 --> 24:26.880
I'm being treated specially for the first time

292
24:27.630 --> 24:29.200
in my life.

293
24:31.480 --> 24:33.290
You are very special to me, Mr. Jang.

294
24:33.290 --> 24:34.630
So,

295
24:35.660 --> 24:37.430
please continue this.

296
24:44.310 --> 24:49.680
[Boy, with Caution]

297
24:49.900 --> 24:51.220
Is this your way?

298
24:51.390 --> 24:53.830
Asking me to keep giving you special treatment?

299
24:53.830 --> 24:54.940
Don't break up.

300
24:55.050 --> 24:57.420
In the eyes of others,

301
24:57.550 --> 24:58.900
that is a flaw.

302
24:59.030 --> 25:00.660
How long do I have to play along

303
25:00.660 --> 25:01.520
with this crap?

304
25:01.620 --> 25:03.350
I'm coming over now. Where are you?

305
25:03.350 --> 25:04.730
I'll contact them.

306
25:04.880 --> 25:05.680
Go take a look.

307
25:05.740 --> 25:08.390
That guy likes people like you.

308
25:09.470 --> 25:11.370
If you have nothing to use as collateral,

309
25:11.370 --> 25:12.320
use yourself.

310
25:12.570 --> 25:13.610
A guest?

311
25:15.110 --> 25:16.250
Is it your student?

312
25:16.480 --> 25:17.500
How many preceded me,

313
25:17.500 --> 25:18.750
Mr. Jang?

314
25:19.950 --> 25:20.960
I

315
25:21.150 --> 25:23.990
hope you only have me.
